{"3734490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World 23", "steam_appid": 3734490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World23</strong> is a fast-paced, top-down hack and slash RPG built <strong>exclusively for two-player co-op</strong>. Step into the boots of <strong>Theo</strong> and <strong>Leo</strong>—elite agents deployed into hostile urban warzones, shadowy metro tunnels, and heavily guarded enemy facilities. In this ruthless sci-fi world, surviving means fighting as one.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/3b51f12892eb9611fcb5960fb156a832.poster.avif?t=1785937330\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/3b51f12892eb9611fcb5960fb156a832.webm?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/3b51f12892eb9611fcb5960fb156a832.mp4?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master brutal melee combat and adapt on the fly. Switch weapons mid-fight to match the chaos around you—from lightning-fast blade combos to crushing heavy strikes. Drop <strong>Gravity Dive</strong> to flatten entire squads, or warp space with <strong>Quantum Rift</strong>. Most importantly, <strong>combine your abilities with your partner to trigger devastating combo effects</strong> and wipe out the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/32338bfc2372208a125ed0c34787c233.poster.avif?t=1785937330\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/32338bfc2372208a125ed0c34787c233.webm?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/32338bfc2372208a125ed0c34787c233.mp4?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive brutal boss fights, dodge hostile drones along subway tracks, and hack security terminals to clear your path. Every mission demands tight coordination, throwing fresh objectives, shifting layouts, and environmental hazards that force you and your teammate to stay mobile and react instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/4c4d42db28ad99655ef350aff9d0d688.poster.avif?t=1785937330\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/4c4d42db28ad99655ef350aff9d0d688.webm?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/4c4d42db28ad99655ef350aff9d0d688.mp4?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in local couch co-op or online co-op. <strong>No single-player. No AI partners. Strictly two-player survival.</strong> Synergize your skills, cover each other's backs, and tear through the chaos together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strictly Two-Player Co-Op:</strong> Designed ground-up for co-op with shared tactics and skill synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ability Combination System:</strong> Merge your attacks with your teammate to unleash massive battlefield effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed Top-Down Combat:</strong> Fluid hack-and-slash action paired with RPG progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weapon Swapping:</strong> Switch weapons instantly during fights to adapt to any situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gritty Sci-Fi Universe:</strong> Battle across ruined megacities, dark subway lines, and enemy bases.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up. Partner up. Dominate the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/a21a0b2d8427b7bb9099eedb246fcfe2.poster.avif?t=1785937330\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/a21a0b2d8427b7bb9099eedb246fcfe2.webm?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/a21a0b2d8427b7bb9099eedb246fcfe2.mp4?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World23</strong> is a fast-paced, top-down hack and slash RPG built <strong>exclusively for two-player co-op</strong>. Step into the boots of <strong>Theo</strong> and <strong>Leo</strong>—elite agents deployed into hostile urban warzones, shadowy metro tunnels, and heavily guarded enemy facilities. In this ruthless sci-fi world, surviving means fighting as one.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/3b51f12892eb9611fcb5960fb156a832.poster.avif?t=1785937330\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/3b51f12892eb9611fcb5960fb156a832.webm?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat