 type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/4c4d42db28ad99655ef350aff9d0d688.mp4?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in local couch co-op or online co-op. <strong>No single-player. No AI partners. Strictly two-player survival.</strong> Synergize your skills, cover each other's backs, and tear through the chaos together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strictly Two-Player Co-Op:</strong> Designed ground-up for co-op with shared tactics and skill synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ability Combination System:</strong> Merge your attacks with your teammate to unleash massive battlefield effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed Top-Down Combat:</strong> Fluid hack-and-slash action paired with RPG progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weapon Swapping:</strong> Switch weapons instantly during fights to adapt to any situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gritty Sci-Fi Universe:</strong> Battle across ruined megacities, dark subway lines, and enemy bases.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up. Partner up. Dominate the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/a21a0b2d8427b7bb9099eedb246fcfe2.poster.avif?t=1785937330\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/a21a0b2d8427b7bb9099eedb246fcfe2.webm?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734490/extras/a21a0b2d8427b7bb9099eedb246fcfe2.mp4?t=1785937330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></